<div class="wrap section" style="max-width:480px"><div class="panel"><h1 style="font-size:28px">Connexion</h1><p class="muted">Accédez à vos commandes, devis et fichiers.</p>
<form method="post" action="/compte/connexion"><?= csrf_field() ?><div class="field"><label for="e">E-mail</label><input id="e" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="username" autofocus></div><div class="field"><label for="p">Mot de passe</label><input id="p" type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></div>
<button class="btn btn-a btn-lg btn-block" type="submit">Se connecter</button></form><p style="margin:16px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px"><a href="/compte/mot-de-passe-oublie">Mot de passe oublié ?</a><a href="/compte/inscription"><b>Créer un compte</b></a></p></div></div>
